    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 3 of the most popular card games with smart &amp; powerful AI co-players, who won\u2019t forget the game\u2019s rules:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >French Belote \u2013 the original: a trick-taking game played by four players in two teams, using a 32-card deck, and featuring Ace-Ten cards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contr\u00e9e \u2013 a variant of Belote with advanced bidding options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coinche \u2013 a variant of Belote with even further advanced bidding options, declarations, and No Trumps &amp; All Trump modes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*** HIGHLIGHTS ***</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful AI partner &amp; opponents \u2013 choose a skill level: beginner, intermediate, or expert &amp; accept the challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart, interactive gameplay hints at your fingertips: not sure which card to play? Our strong built-in AI help will assist you in making the right choice. You'll become a Belote pro in no time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your experience with French &amp; International card sets, multiple card backs, table backgrounds, and ten soothing soundtracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed integrated rules included.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful statistics will help you track &amp; improve your results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience crisp HD graphics and beautiful animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in Fullscreen or Window mode, Portrait or Landscape  \u2013 Belote 3in1 will auto adapt to (nearly) any screen size and aspect ratio.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*** HIGHLY CONFIGURABLE GAMEPLAY ***</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the original rules &amp; wide range of advanced options:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with or without No Trumps / All Trumps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with or without Belote and Rebelote in All Trumps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely choose your preferred points-per-game goal for quick or longer gameplay sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obligation or not to &quot;piss&quot; Trump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obligation or not to ''force'' Trump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obligation or not to pass on Jack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vache game mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Belote counts for the success or failure of a contract</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hanging points at deuce</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double points for No Trumps / All Trumps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >130 points at No Trumps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >258 points at All Trumps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic play (when there is only one card to play)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show or hide the table score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pro feature: speed up your gameplay by supercharging animations &amp; disabling card-dealing animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized card sorting for left-handed &amp; right-handed players </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with or without Generale contract (Coinche &amp; Contree)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allow the ability to Surcoinche/Redouble (Coinche &amp; Contree)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bid on Capot contract</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more\u2026</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 3 of the most popular card games with smart &amp; powerful AI co-players, who won\u2019t forget the game\u2019s rules:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >French Belote \u2013 the original: a trick-taking game played by four players in two teams, using a 32-card deck, and featuring Ace-Ten cards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contr\u00e9e \u2013 a variant of Belote with advanced bidding options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coinche \u2013 a variant of Belote with even further advanced bidding options, declarations, and No Trumps &amp; All Trump modes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*** HIGHLIGHTS ***</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful AI partner &amp; opponents \u2013 choose a skill level: beginner, intermediate, or expert &amp; accept the challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart, interactive gameplay hints at your fingertips: not sure which card to play? Our strong built-in AI help will assist you in making the right choice. You'll become a Belote pro in no time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your experience with French &amp; International card sets, multiple card backs, table backgrounds, and ten soothing soundtracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed integrated rules included.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful statistics will help you track &amp; improve your results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience crisp HD graphics and beautiful animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in Fullscreen or Window mode, Portrait or Landscape  \u2013 Belote 3in1 will auto adapt to (nearly) any screen size and aspect ratio.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*** HIGHLY CONFIGURABLE GAMEPLAY ***</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the original rules &amp; wide range of advanced options:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with or without No Trumps / All Trumps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with or without Belote and Rebelote in All Trumps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely choose your preferred points-per-game goal for quick or longer gameplay sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obligation or not to &quot;piss&quot; Trump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obligation or not to ''force'' Trump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obligation or not to pass on Jack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vache game mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Belote counts for the success or failure of a contract</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hanging points at deuce</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double points for No Trumps / All Trumps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >130 points at No Trumps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >258 points at All Trumps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic play (when there is only one card to play)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show or hide the table score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pro feature: speed up your gameplay by supercharging animations &amp; disabling card-dealing animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized card sorting for left-handed &amp; right-handed players </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with or without Generale contract (Coinche &amp; Contree)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allow the ability to Surcoinche/Redouble (Coinche &amp; Contree)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bid on Capot contract</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more\u2026</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Experience the ultimate Belote game with our feature-packed app that brings the classic French card game to life! Our digital version offers Belote, Coinche, and Contr\u00e9e, all in one place - enjoy a wide range of customization options to tailor your gameplay experience.",
